      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUT OF LUCK (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (19.04) in a Grade 5 at this track. Smart beginner who should take advantage of the low draw. Rates on top in this line up. VINTAGE LUCY (5) has been hard to follow lately, running fourth (23.63) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at this track. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Expected to do much better this time. MR. SNIPER (7) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing third (18.70) at this track in a Maiden over 320m. Leading player again. BELLE'S CHARM (1) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
